PetalburgCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_TreeckoIsGrassType:
	.string "For example, your SQUEESH\n"
	.string "is a POISON type.\p"
	.string "It's strong against the GRASS and\n"
	.string "FAIRY types.\p"
	.string "But, it's weak against GROUND-type\n"
	.string "and PSYCHIC-type POKéMON.$"

PetalburgCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_TorchicIsFireType:
	.string "For example, your BEANITO\n"
	.string "is a DARK type.\p"
	.string "It's strong against the PSYCHIC and\n"
	.string "GHOST types.\p"
	.string "But, it's weak against FIGHTING,\n"
	.string "BUG, and FAIRY-type POKéMON.$"

PetalburgCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_MudkipIsWaterType:
	.string "For example, your GUARDPUP\n"
	.string "is a FIGHTING type.\p"
	.string "It's strong against NORMAL, ROCK,\n"
	.string "STEEL, ICE, and DARK types.\p"
	.string "But, it's weak against FLYING,\n"
	.string "PSYCHIC, and FAIRY-type POKéMON.$"
